{"_id":"r2wrgLJKyppjslNv","name":"Osphranteal","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/osphranteal.webp","items":[{"_id":"JjTQMNG6ZAKe98FJ","name":"Mob Defense","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature rolls a critical hit to Strike a creature adjacent to the osphranteal;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The osphranteal boldly intercepts the attack. Damage dealt by the triggering Strike is divided evenly between the osphranteal and the struck creature. The osphranteal and the struck creature are both affected by any effects that the triggering Strike would normally apply on a hit, but neither defender takes any effects that apply on only a critical hit.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"DcR4LlB0elI7GfJr","name":"Double Kick","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The osphranteal balances on its tail, then makes two foot Strikes against an enemy within reach. On a hit, the osphranteal automatically Shoves the target, with the same benefits as the Shove action (including the critical success effect, if its Strike was a critical hit). If the osphranteal moves to follow the target, its movement doesn't trigger reactions. The osphranteal's multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after both Strikes are resolved. If both Strikes hit the same target, add up the damage before applying resistance or weakness, and add up the Shove distance. If the target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or otherwise unable to move away from the osphranteal, the target isn't Shoved but it takes an additional [[/r 10[slashing]]]{10 slashing} from osphranteal's massive hind claws.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"RAjXH4mlverVsoZp","name":"Prodigious Leap","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The osphranteal Leaps up to 20 feet vertically or up to 40 feet horizontally. If the osphranteal spent its previous action to move at least 20 feet, these distances increase to 25 feet and 50 feet, respectively. At any point during the Leap, the osphranteal can make a foot Strike.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"5sJ3CgOWna8nmh6R","name":"Protective Pouch","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The osphranteal puts a willing or helpless Medium or smaller creature in its pouch. While in the pouch, the creature has cover and @Compendium[pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.fJSNOw4zHGbIm4bZ]{Fast Healing 1} and gains a +2 status bonus on saving throws against any ongoing afflictions.</p>\n<p>The osphranteal can spend a single action to remove a creature from its pouch (this action has the manipulate trait).</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.dwNBjigsAp30gGnj]{Effect: Protective Pouch}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","healing","manipulate"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"oONXcdsbGI5lPN5b","name":"Grab","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"d