},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":true},"displayLevels":{}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"gZXv1dhGTFB54Flz","name":"Drop Dead","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/drop-dead.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within range is hit by an attack from an enemy.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The target appears to fall down dead, though it actually turns @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. Its illusory corpse remains where it fell, complete with a believable fatal wound. This illusion looks and feels like a dead body. If the target's death seems absurd-for instance, a barbarian at full health appears to be slain by 2 damage-the GM can grant the attacker an immediate Perception check to disbelieve the illusion. If the target uses hostile actions, the spell ends. This ends the entire spell, so the illusory corpse disappears too.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The spell doesn't end if the target uses hostile actions.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"drop-dead","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["illusion","manipulate","visual"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"reaction"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.scTRIrTfXquVYHGw","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"fxLEPURURJnLO2g1","name":"Air Walk","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/air-walk.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target can walk on air as if it were solid ground. It can ascend and descend in this way at a maximum of a 45-degree angle.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"air-walk","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["air","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"5 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.b5sGjGlBf58f8jn0","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"tABBNy0txMD6q3PS","name":"Speak with Animals (Constant)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/speak-with-animals.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":600000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You can ask questions of, receive answers from, and use the Diplomacy skill with animals. The spell doesn't make them more friendly than normal. Cunning animals are likely to be terse and evasive, while less intelligent ones often make inane comments.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"speak-with-animals","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.BBvV7qoXGdw09q1C","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"LX3ZMrO693XViF62","name":"Neutralize Poison","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/neutralize-poison.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":400000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You pour healing magic through the target in an attempt to cure one poison afflicting it. Attempt a counteract check against the poison.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"neutralize-poison","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","healing","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":true},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"2yiRBLE8bbFujY7X","name":"Dimension Door","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dimension-door.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Opening a door that bypasses normal space, you instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to a clear space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you-even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container-the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dimension-door","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","teleportation"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"range":{"value":"1 mile"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"G2r1zD5eIl7dJJMt","name":"Freedom of Movement","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/freedom-of-movement.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You repel effects that would hinder a creature or slow its movement. While under this spell's effect, the target ignores effects that would give them a circumstance penalty to Speed. When they attempt to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} an effect that has them @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}, or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, they automatically succeed unless the effect is magical and of a higher level than the freedom of movement spell.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"freedom-of-movement","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature touched"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aqRYNoSvxsVfqglH","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"3POuZEQMwXQT9tOj","name":"Wanderer's Guide","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/wanderer's-guide.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You call upon the beyond to guide your route. When you Cast this Spell, choose a destination; you receive an inspired route to that destination, allowing you and allies who travel overland with you to reduce the movement penalty from difficult terrain by half for the duration, as long as you don't deviate from the inspired route. This doesn't have any effect on movement during encounters. If you use this ability again before the duration is over, this effect ends and is replaced by that of the new route.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"wanderers-guide","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1 minute"},"duration":{"value":"until your next daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.ppA1StEigPLKEQqR","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"mLVRiDRjUAUiUVLc","name":"Enhance Victuals (At Will)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/enhance-victuals.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You transform the target into delicious fare, changing water into wine or another fine beverage or enhancing the food's taste and ingredients to make it a gourmet treat.</p>\n<p>Prior to the transformation, the spell attempts to counteract any poisons in the food or water. The food turns back to normal if not consumed before the duration expires, though any poisons that were counteracted are still gone.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The number of gallons of water you can target increases by 1, or the number of pounds of food you can target increases by 5.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"enhance-victuals","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"up to 1 gallon of non-magical water or up to 5 pounds of food"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1 minute"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":true},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.rdTEF1hfAWbN58NE","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"tEGzPTPmTzPxX19b","name":"Shield Other","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/shield-other.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You forge a temporary link between the target's life essence and your own. The target takes half damage from all effects that deal Hit Point damage, and you take the remainder of the damage. When you take damage through this link, you don't apply any resistances, weaknesses, or other abilities you have to that damage; you simply take that amount of damage. The spell ends if the target is ever more than 30 feet away from you. If either you or the target is reduced to 0 Hit Points, any damage from this spell is resolved and then the spell ends.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"shield-other","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.d7Lwx6KAs47MtF0q","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"K5OeBi7ibwkVBrQS","name":"Shield Other","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/shield-other.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You forge a temporary link between the target's life essence and your own. The target takes half damage from all effects that deal Hit Point damage, and you take the remainder of the damage. When you take damage through this link, you don't apply any resistances, weaknesses, or other abilities you have to that damage; you simply take that amount of damage. The spell ends if the target is ever more than 30 feet away from you. If either you or the target is reduced to 0 Hit Points, any damage from this spell is resolved and then the spell ends.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"shield-other","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.d7Lwx6KAs47MtF0q","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"JdcaAnEbiotd3Suu","name":"Shield Other","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/shield-other.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You forge a temporary link between the target's life essence and your own. The target takes half damage from all effects that deal Hit Point damage, and you take the remainder of the damage. When you take damage through this link, you don't apply any resistances, weaknesses, or other abilities you have to that damage; you simply take that amount of damage. The spell ends if the target is ever more than 30 feet away from you. If either you or the target is reduced to 0 Hit Points, any damage from this spell is resolved and then the spell ends.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"shield-other","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.d7Lwx6KAs47MtF0q","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"OJWYBo0rAPgeQo23","name":"Detect Alignment (At Will) (Evil Only)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-alignment.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Your eyes glow as you sense aligned auras. Choose chaotic, evil, good, or lawful. You detect auras of that alignment. You receive no information beyond presence or absence. You can choose not to detect creatures or effects you're aware have that alignment.</p>\n<p>Only creatures of 6th level or higher-unless divine spellcasters, undead, or beings from the Outer Sphere-have alignment auras.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> You learn each aura's location and strength.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"detect-alignment","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"value":30,"type":"emanation"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.QnTtGCAvdWRU4spv","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"b0DJhsxTIZczhGu9","name":"Tongues (Constant)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tongues.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":700000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target can understand all words regardless of language and also speak the languages of other creatures. When in a mixed group of creatures, each time the target speaks, it can choose a creature and speak in a language that creature understands, even if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"tongues","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"kQjYLEv1NfMaeQqG","name":"At-Will Spells","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AtWillSpells]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"at-will-spells","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.2YRDYVnC1eljaXKK","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"IeFe2KnSdL3RDmbW","name":"Remove Disease","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/remove-disease.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":500000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Healing magic purges disease from a creature's body. You attempt to counteract one disease afflicting the target.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"remove-disease","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","healing","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"CACeo2Z7nuWr0YPW","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":true},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.RneiyehRO6f7LP44","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"pf2e":{"lootable":false},"core":{}},"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":210,"temp":0,"max":210,"details":""},"ac":{"value":30,"details":"","base":30},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"weaknesses":[{"type":"unholy","value":10}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","daemonic","diabolic","draconic","empyrean"],"details":"speak with animals; tongues"},"level":{"value":10},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Osphranteals are majestic marsupials that roam the celestial plains of the plane of Nirvana. An osphranteal stands noble on fearsome hind legs, supported by a massive tail. Its upper torso is that of a muscular, deeply tanned humanoid, with a serene facial expression that belies the danger posed to evildoers by its powerful limbs.</p>\n<p>Osphranteals cherish healthy growth and appreciate a selfless nature. They have strong protective feelings toward non-evil creatures smaller than themselves, whom they strive at all times to shelter from harm to the best of their ability.</p>\n<p>During times of peace, highly ritualized brawling tournaments are an honored osphranteal pastime. In such tournaments, osphranteals duke it out among their own kind and with any other willing creatures deemed to be worthy challengers. There is no grand prize at stake, only the knowledge that the tourney's winner is the best suited individual to protect others—a status for which many osphranteals would fight tirelessly.</p>\n<h2>Sworn Enemies</h2>\n<p>While osphranteals despise any kind of evil, they hold a special enmity toward daemons in general and meladaemons in particular, whom they seek to defeat at every opportunity. No one knows where the ancient grudge between osphranteals and meladaemons came from, though the daemons of starvation are only too happy to return their celestial counterparts' hatred.</p>\n<h2>Monster Part Subsystem</h2>\n<p><strong>Osphranteal (Kangaroo Agathion) Creature 10 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 125/275/500 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, slashing), armor (light, medium), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Medicine, Nature, Survival)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, dexterity, energy resistant (positive), good, sensory (darkvision), spells (Divine: air walk, detect alignment, dimension door, drop dead, enhance victuals, freedom of movement, neutralize poison, remove disease, shield other, speak with animals, tongues, wanderer’s guide), strength, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary","authors":"Vadim Hesin","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":3},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":2}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":19,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":21,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":17},"athletics":{"base":25},"medicine":{"base":19},"nature":{"base":19},"survival":{"base":17}},"traits":{"value":["agathion","celestial","good","holy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"lg"}},"customModifiers":{}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"proto